window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>What if courage was your only option?</p> <p>When the three of them had slowly climbed out of the cave, Kalie knew Caleb and Liam would protect her forever. Not because they had to, but because they wanted to.</p> <p>She'd gotten away then.</p> <p>Maybe someday she would find Petra again.</p> <p>Or Petra would find her.</p> <p>Kallie pressed her lips into a tight line. Whatever happened next, she was ready for it.</p> <p>Fall in love with immortal vampires and werewolves in this paranormal fantasy series.</p> <p><b>Blood Red Series:</b></p> <p></p> <ol> <li><i>Courage Runs Red</i></li> <li><i>Night Watch</i></li> <li><i>Marked by Courage</i></li> <li><i>Forever Night</i></li> <li><i>The Other Side of Fear</i></li> </ol>"; 
